---
// Memory mockup: say it once, it sticks — and gets used later.
---

<div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3 px-4 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12.5px] leading-snug">
  <div class="self-end max-w-[82%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-[#6d4aff] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-white">
    Btw I'm vegetarian now, and I always want an aisle seat
  </div>

  <div class="glass self-start flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#c9b8ff]">
    <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#c9b8ff]"></span>
    2 things remembered
  </div>

  <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
    <span class="chip">vegetarian</span>
    <span class="chip">aisle seat</span>
    <span class="chip">home: Bristol</span>
    <span class="chip">passport saved</span>
    <span class="chip">16–25 railcard</span>
    <span class="chip">gym Tue/Thu</span>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div class="self-end max-w-[82%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-[#6d4aff] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-white">
      Book dinner near the office Thursday
    </div>
    <div class="self-start max-w-[88%] text-white/85 px-1">
      Done — 7:30pm at <span class="font-semibold text-white">Wilder</span>, they confirmed a
      <span class="font-semibold text-white">vegetarian tasting menu</span>. After your gym class.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
